+		mlanutl mlan0 regioncode 0x10    : Set region code to USA (0x10)
+	Note : in some case regioncode will be 0 after updated countycode or 80211d
+		i.e. mlanutl mlanX countrycode  (CA, JP, CN, DE, ES AT, BR, RU)
