+##                 1: OFDM (6,9,12,18 Mbps)
+##                 2: OFDM (24,36 Mbps)
+##                 3: OFDM (48,54 Mbps)
+##                 4: HT20 (0,1,2)
+##                 5: HT20 (3,4)
