+##                 14: VHT_80_QAM64 (MCS5,6,7)
+##                 15: VHT_80_QAM256 (MCS8,9)
+##               Power Limit in dBm
+##
+## For 40MHz modulation groups, specify same Tx power value for a set of
+## two consecutive channel frequencies
