+	 **     1       GO Negotiation Response
+	 **     2       GO Negotiation Confirmation
+	 **     3       P2P Invitation Request
+	 **     4       P2P Invitation Response
+	 **     5       Device Discoverability Request
+	 **     6       Device Discoverability Response
+	 **     7       Provision Discovery Request
