+ *
+ *  @param priv          A pointer to moal_private structure
+ *  @param wait_option          Wait option
+ *  @param ssid_bssid    A point to mlan_ssid_bssid structure
+ *
+ *  @return              MLAN_STATUS_SUCCESS/MLAN_STATUS_PENDING -- success,
